 "page_md": "**WR Weaver, Rodriguez and Hobbs** Carrier Performance Review · 2024\n\n# **Carrier Performance Review**\n\nThis report summarizes key indicators for Weaver, Rodriguez and Hobbs for fiscal 2024.\n\n| Quarter | Truckload | Less than truckload | Rail | Intermodal |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Q2-21 | 3,022 | 240 | 8,823 | 7,360 |\n| Q3-21 | 2,925 | 246 | 9,444 | 7,724 |\n| Q4-21 | 3,184 | 247 | 9,384 | 7,597 |\n| Q1-22 | 3,449 | 261 | 8,887 | 7,286 |\n| Q2-22 | 3,517 | 261 | 9,433 | 7,783 |\n\nSource: Internal data, 2024.\n\nTruckload moved from 3,022 in Q2-21 to 3,517 in Q2-22. The highest value was recorded for Q2-22 (3,517). The variance reflects seasonal factors and the timing of several large items.\n\n## **Key findings**\n\n- Shipments by mode: Q3-21 at 2,925.\n\n**Table 1.** Average transit time\n\n| Month | Domestic | Cross-border |\n|---|---|---|\n| Sep | 4.1 | 2.3 |\n| Oct | 3.9 | 2.3 |\n| Nov | 4.2 | 2.1 |\n| Dec | 3.9 | 2.1 |\n| Jan | 4.2 | 2.1 |\n| Feb | 3.9 | 2.2 |\n| Mar | 4.2 | 2.4 |\n| Apr | 4.3 | 2.5 |\n| May | 4.8 | 2.8 |\n\nWeaver, Rodriguez and Hobbs Page 8 of 28",
